                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} f : X_1 \xrightarrow{\;} X_2
                between classical types a
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/yoga+of+six+operations"} yoga of six operations
                (specifically: a “
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Wirthm%C3%BCller+context"}> Wirthmüller context
                ”) between their types of dependent linear types, hence a
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/contravariant+functor"} contravariant
                = succeed "/" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/substitution"} substitution
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pullback"} pullback
                operation
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
